---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms of Service — AllieMinate" description="Terms for downloading, installing, and using AllieMinate." path="/terms">
  <Nav />
  <main id="main" class="legal-page">
    <div class="wrap legal-wrap">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: August 11, 2026</p>

      <h2>Acceptance</h2>
      <p>By downloading, installing, or using AllieMinate, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, don't use the app.</p>

      <h2>What AllieMinate is</h2>
      <p>AllieMinate is a free, open-source cloud storage aggregation and device-sync application for macOS, Windows, and Android. Source code is available at <a href="https://github.com/1nonlyvansh/AllieMinate" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/1nonlyvansh/AllieMinate</a>.</p>

      <h2>Your accounts and data</h2>
      <p>Any cloud accounts you connect, and any devices you pair, remain entirely under your own control. AllieMinate acts only as a local interface between you and the services/devices you choose to connect — see the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for details on how that access is handled.</p>

      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>AllieMinate is provided "as is," without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to fitness for a particular purpose or non-infringement. You use it at your own risk.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>The developer is not liable for any data loss, corruption, or damages arising from use of AllieMinate, including issues caused by third-party cloud providers, network conditions, or bugs. Always keep independent backups of anything important.</p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>Don't use AllieMinate to access accounts, devices, or data you don't have the right to access.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>These terms may be updated from time to time; the current version always lives at this URL.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:vansh080605@gmail.com">vansh080605@gmail.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-top: 128px;
  }
  .legal-wrap {
    max-width: 720px;
    padding-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }
  .legal-wrap h1 {
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .legal-wrap .updated {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 6px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .legal-wrap h2 {
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .legal-wrap p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .legal-wrap a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .legal-wrap a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
